  "_comment": [
    "EXALTED multilingual UI strings, one block per shippable language.",
    "Order of objects = display order in the /lang picker.",
    "Edition lines are transcribed from each source's own in-file metadata",
    "(OSIS <identification> title/description or module header) - never guessed:",
    "  cze  Bible Kralicka, description says 'posledniho vydani Kralickeho z roku 1613'",
    "  deu  'Lutherbibel von 1912'",
    "  dut  'Dutch Statenvertaling', no edition year in file -> no year shown",
    "  pol  module PolUG (Gdanska), description dates the text to 1838, no apocrypha",
    "  es   RV1909 printed PDF, sha256 1d8545c5... (docs/RV1909-SOURCE.md)",
    "stats_book/stats_chapter/stats_verse put the NOUN BEFORE the numeral on",
    "purpose: Slavic/Czech/Polish plural forms inflect after the numeral, and a",
    "runtime-correct plural selector is not worth it for a stats line. Noun-first",
    "reads fine and is grammatical in every one of these languages."
  ],
